      "description": "A tier letter in the display voice over the rank column, then a hairline; only S is orange.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-tier\"><span class=\"ds-tier-l\">S</span><span class=\"ds-tier-t\">Power tier S</span><span class=\"ds-tier-m\">8 players, 365.6 to 328.4 pts</span><span class=\"ds-tier-r\"></span></div>",
      "css": ".ds-tier{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;gap:12px;font:400 13px 'Sofia Sans',ui-sans-serif,sans-serif}.ds-tier-l{width:48px;text-align:right;padding-right:12px;font:italic 900 34px/.8 'Sofia Sans Extra Condensed',sans-serif;color:var(--color-ki,#ff8a3d)}.ds-tier-t{color:var(--color-ink,#eef2fa);font-weight:600}.ds-tier-m{color:var(--color-mute,#9aa6bd)}.ds-tier-r{flex:1;height:1px;margin-bottom:6px;background:rgb(148 170 210 / .13)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "The Stops",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "stops-thumb",
      "description": "The landing's switch (SegmentedControl, variant stops): equal columns on the Well step, each option a whole figure, every option in ink; the chosen one sits on a Lift thumb with the 2px energy base line, which slides.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-stops\" role=\"radiogroup\"><span class=\"ds-stops-thumb\"></span><label><b>0 PPR</b><small>0 per catch</small><em>#7</em></label><label><b>Half PPR</b><small>0.5 per catch</small><em>#1</em></label><label class=\"on\"><b>PPR</b><small>1 per catch</small><em>#1</em></label></div>",
      "css": ".ds-stops{position:relative;display:grid;grid-auto-flow:column;grid-auto-columns:1fr;padding:4px;border-radius:4px;background:var(--color-well,#111a2c);font:400 12px 'Sofia Sans',ui-sans-serif,sans-serif;color:var(--color-ink,#eef2fa)}.ds-stops label{position:relative;z-index:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;padding:12px 16px;cursor:pointer}.ds-stops b{font-weight:600;font-size:15px}.ds-stops small{color:var(--color-mute,#9aa6bd)}.ds-stops em{margin-top:12px;font:italic 850 48px/.8 'Sofia Sans Extra Condensed',ui-sans-serif,sans-serif}.ds-stops-thumb{position:absolute;top:4px;bottom:4px;left:calc(4px + 2 * (100% - 8px) / 3);width:calc((100% - 8px)/3);border-radius:2px;background:var(--color-lift,#1a2540);box-shadow:inset 0 -2px 0 var(--color-energy,#3d8bff);transition:left .3s ease-out}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Join Form (Daylight)",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "input-daylight",
      "description": "Email and password side by side, the password waiting until the email is in, and the orange join as its own 56px block.",
      "html": "<form class=\"ds-join\"><label>Email<input type=\"email\"></label><label>Password <small>after your email</small><input type=\"password\" disabled></label><button type=\"button\">Join the Kai</button></form>",
      "css": ".ds-join{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;max-width:34rem;font:600 13px 'Sofia Sans',ui-sans-serif,sans-serif;color:#0b1530}.ds-join small{float:right;font-weight:400;color:#46526a}.ds-join input{display:block;width:100%;height:48px;margin-top:6px;padding:0 16px;border:1px solid #7a8599;border-radius:4px;background:#fff;font:400 16px 'Sofia Sans',ui-sans-serif,sans-serif;color:#0b1530;transition:border-color .15s}.ds-join input:hover{border-color:#46526a}.ds-join input:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #2468ff;outline-offset:2px;border-color:#2468ff}.ds-join input:disabled{background:#fbfaf7;border-color:rgb(36 104 255 / .16);cursor:not-allowed}.ds-join button{grid-column:1/-1;justify-self:start;height:56px;padding:0 28px;border:0;border-radius:4px;background:#ff8a3d;color:#140a02;font:600 16px 'Sofia Sans',ui-sans-serif,sans-serif;cursor:pointer;transition:filter .15s}.ds-join button:hover{filter:brightness(1.1)}.ds-join button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #2468ff;outline-offset:2px}"
    }
